OL,3,GNEWSA'I'm shocked doctors haven't heard
OL,4,Aof my invisible cancer'
OL,5,
OL,6,F"I was very surprised that so few
OL,7,Fpeople had heard about it - the general
OL,8,Fpublic, perhaps, but clinicians - that
OL,9,Fshocked me," said Wood.
OL,11,FThe BBC has contacted NHS England and
OL,12,Fthe Department for Health and Social
OL,13,FCare for comment.
